ou have the option to Check (0) and see the flop for free. Raising would bloat the pot with a weak hand, and folding is irrational when you can proceed for free. Since this is the last hand and you hold a cumulative chip lead, your primary goal should be to minimize variance and risk to secure the overall win.\n\nReason: You are in the Big Blind and can see the flop for free after the opponent limped. Your hand is too weak to raise for value, and there is no reason to fold when checking costs nothing. Checking minimizes risk, preserving your cumulative lead.\n\nAnswer: 0'}
